    <title>2026-08-26, Version 26.8.1 (Current), @aduh95</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Notable Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Out-of-band release to fix &lt;code&gt;node --version&lt;/code&gt; which was reporting an alpha version.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/ebd35a9eec&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ebd35a9eec&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;] - &lt;strong&gt;src&lt;/strong&gt;: revert accidental alpha designation (Antoine du Hamel) &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/65568&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/nodejs/node/pull/65568/hovercard&quot;&gt;#65568&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nodejs/node/commit/0b0dd87fcc&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;0b0dd87fcc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;] - &lt;strong&gt;tools&lt;/strong&gt;: fix &lt;code&gt;tools/nix/list-requisites.sh&lt;/code&gt; (Antoine du Hamel) &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/65560&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/nodejs/node/pull/65560/hovercard&quot;&gt;#65560&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
